# SHIFT (SEL) + white key 3 opens the Clip page: KNOB1 down to 1/2X, and
# while playing up to 2X; KNOB2 shortens the clip to 8 steps, KNOB3
# transposes it a fifth, KNOB4 quantizes it at 50 %.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--button 0.10:SEL:0.05
--key 0.12:4:100:0.01
--turn 0.20:KNOB1:-2
--button 0.30:PLAY/STOP
--turn 1.30:KNOB1:4
--turn 2.00:KNOB2:-8
--turn 2.40:KNOB3:7
--turn 2.60:KNOB4:5
